Patients |\n|---|---|\n| Springfield Hospital | 288 |\n| Ashtead Hospital | 226 |\n| Pinehill Hospital | 216 |\n| Rivers Hospital | 190 |\n| Oaklands Hospital | 179 |\n\n*Sources: Patient Activity & Finance*"}, {"stage": "turn_record", "record": {"question": "How many patients over 55 referred for Trauma and Orthopaedics are on an admitted RTT pathway, by hospital?", "per_agent": [{"sql": "SELECT w.LocationName AS Hospital, COUNT(*) AS Patients\nFROM ramsay_health.ops.tbreferrals r\nJOIN ramsay_health.ops.tbwlmds w ON r.ReferralID = w.ReferralID\nWHERE r.AgeAtDateOfReferral > 55 AND r.ServiceName = ''Trauma and Orthopaedics'' AND r.HasAdmission = 1 AND w.LocationName IS NOT NULL\nGROUP BY w.LocationName\nORDER BY Patients DESC", "agent": "patient_finance", "error": null, "row_count": 5, "agentLabel": "Patient Activity & Finance", "latency_ms": 9389, "row_preview": [["Springfield Hospital", "288"], ["Ashtead Hospital", "226"], ["Pinehill Hospital", "216"], ["Rivers Hospital", "190"], ["Oaklands Hospital", "179"]], "sub_question": "How many patients over 55 referred for Trauma and Orthopaedics are on an admitted RTT pathway by hospital?"}], "chart_spec": {"data": [{"Hospital": "Springfield Hospital", "Patients": 288}, {"Hospital": "Ashtead Hospital", "Patients": 226}, {"Hospital": "Pinehill Hospital", "Patients": 216}, {"Hospital": "Rivers Hospital", "Patients": 190}, {"Hospital": "Oaklands Hospital", "Patients": 179}], "title": "Patients over 55 on Admitted RTT Pathway by Hospital", "xField": "Hospital", "yField": "Patients", "chartType": "bar"}, "agents_called": ["Patient Activity & Finance"], "guardrail_events": [], "agent_keys_called": ["patient_finance"], "final_answer_text": "The numbers of patients over\u202f55 referred for Trauma and Orthopaedics on an admitted RTT pathway are:\n\n| Hospital | Patients |\n|---|---|\n| Springfield Hospital | 288 |\n| Ashtead Hospital | 226 |\n| Pinehill Hospital | 216 |\n| Rivers Hospital | 190 |\n| Oaklands Hospital | 179 |\n\